  "description": "9PM Elixir by Afnan is a rich nighttime fragrance built for boldness — a blend of spicy freshness, warm woods, and sensual amber-musk depth. It opens with fresh spice and crisp citrus brightness, giving a confident first spray that stands out. The heart layers aromatic spices with smooth woods and subtle sweet undertones for a refined yet modern tone. The base dries down into warm amber, deep musk, and creamy woods — giving a long-lasting trail that’s ideal for evenings, special events, or nights out. This scent is perfect for men or anyone who wants a strong, masculine, warm-woody amber signature with good longevity and projection.",
